{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.poster.avif?t=1771521500\" width=560 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.webm?t=1771521500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Narin: The Orange Room is a third-person adventure horror game. Play as Narin, a young girl whose sister mysteriously disappeared. According to rumors circulating among students in the school, those who haven't left before twilight mysteriously vanish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.poster.avif?t=1771521500\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.webm?t=1771521500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.mp4?t=1771521500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Narin accidentally teleports into a grim dimension she never intended to enter. But she knows her sister might be there, so she chooses to stay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.poster.avif?t=1771521500\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.webm?t=1771521500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https